#==============================================================================================
#
#   tokenized_features - window.open()'s features: tokenizing them, parsing a boolean feature
#   and checking if a popup window is requested
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/TokenizedFeatures.cpp (lines 1-200). parse_boolean_feature
#       is a template over the TokenizedFeature enums (each has Yes and No); the port takes the
#       enum's two values as arguments.
